Subject: [PATCH 1/2] DMC/DMP/DMV, DMF32, DMB32: SET ... NOPEER clears the peer
 (known issue 131)

A PEER, once set, could not be cleared: SET <unit> PEER= with no value is
refused.  New commands, each only while the unit is detached:
  SET DMCn NOPEER, SET DMPn NOPEER, SET DMVn NOPEER
  SET DMF NOPEER / SET DMF-SYNC NOPEER
  SET DMB-SYNC NOPEER
combo_sync_clear_peer() serves the DMF32 and DMB32.  HELP texts updated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SuavtcpUxEC2vXhit3JaAg
